  "body": "Please add followRedirects=true/false to XMLHttpRequest specification. Without it there is no possible to catch in onreadystatechange redirection pages (301 and 302 status) and response of them or optionally state 5 in .readyState with possibility of read status code, response and headers. \r\n\r\nDefault value of followRedirects for compatibility: true. ",
